notes.description:
A text field's key each step writes its notes on the record's fields to (docs/adr/0442 §4): the
latest step's notes as canonical JSON (`{"<field key>":"<note>"}`), emptied by a step without;
read-only in the form, shown under the fields.

clip.description:
The part shown, in the picture's own fractions (0,0 its lower left,
1,1 its upper right): at least three corners inside the unit square;
absent: the whole picture.

compose.description:
How it is composed into the drawing (Katman çizimi, docs/adr/0226 §3,
§4): opacity, blending mode, the mask it cuts into other layers;
absent, opaque and normal. Only a layer has it, never a group.

plot.description:
Yazdır: absent, it is printed; `false`, it is drawn on screen but not
on a sheet, its PDF or a print (AutoCAD's plot switch, DXF's 290;
docs/adr/0260 §4). A group's covers what it holds. Only `false` is written.

ms.description:
